OL,3,GNEWSACouncil could use cultural funding
OL,4,Ato reopen tip
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rubbish tip in Bradford could be
OL,7,Freopened using money previously
OL,8,Fearmarked for cultural events,
OL,9,Faccording to a council report.
OL,11,FBradford Council's Reform UK-led
OL,12,Fexecutive is expected to approve plans
OL,13,Fto reopen Sugden End Household Waste
OL,14,FRecycling Centre in Cross Roads, near
OL,15,FKeighley, when the committee meets on 8
OL,16,FSeptember.
OL,18,FThe report said #400,000 of funding for
OL,19,Fcultural events across the district
OL,20,Fwill be pulled and rediverted to pay
OL,21,Ffor the centre to be reopened before
OL,22,FChristmas.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
