OL,3,GNEWSACouncil could use cultural funding
OL,4,Ato reopen tip
OL,5,
OL,6,FIan Walker, the council's portfolio
OL,7,Fholder for Neighbourhoods and
OL,8,FCommunities, said there was a "strong
OL,9,Fcase" for reopening this site.
